# slider-default (h8-points-slider): the x-of-P slider at rest, P=2 on the
# plane's visible range (±9.9 at 1440x900, default camera; the prompt's -5..5
# is the 500x400-fixture equivalent). Thumb at left 208.54px, no tip.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 500
shot slider-default
